    <h1>Reverse Dimension Doctor 6</h1>

<p><i>by Foggy Brume</i><br />
<b>Answer:</b> FETTUCCINE
</p><p><b>Companion Half:  His Botany Student, <a href="http://tardis.wikia.com/wiki/Peri_Brown" class="external text" title="http://tardis.wikia.com/wiki/Peri_Brown" rel="nofollow">Perpugilliam "Peri" Brown</a></b>
